[68.615159, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ parses a signature header with two v1 entries \u001b[90m(1.428176ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[68.616081, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ accepts a correctly signed body \u001b[90m(1.139204ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ rejects a body signed with the wrong secret \u001b[90m(0.807833ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ rejects a stale timestamp \u001b[90m(0.507997ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ policy: small INR refunds auto-approve, others go to review \u001b[90m(0.280687ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ cancelling a pending refund \u001b[90m(3.117438ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ a redelivered event creates only one refund \u001b[90m(0.751947ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ authz: keys map to role permissions \u001b[90m(1.098637ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
