[225.499296, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ parses a signature header with two v1 entries \u001b[90m(1.490814ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ accepts a correctly signed body \u001b[90m(1.199678ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ rejects a body signed with the wrong secret \u001b[90m(2.186344ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ rejects a stale timestamp \u001b[90m(0.485428ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ policy: small INR refunds auto-approve, others go to review \u001b[90m(0.272089ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ cancelling a pending refund \u001b[90m(3.416269ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ a redelivered event creates only one refund \u001b[90m(0.944615ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ authz: keys map to role permissions \u001b[90m(1.416189ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ tests 17\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ suites 0\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ pass 17\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ fail 0\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ cancelled 0\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ skipped 0\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ todo 0\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mℹ duration_ms 262.525932\u001b[39m\r\n"]
